{
  "message": "Your “Sprint 3” devlog reports five-player tide testing, but shares neither a build nor session notes. The checkpoint is behind on evidence, and what got done remains unknown without playable work. This common gap is still fixable this week: share an openable build, co-op instructions and the five-player notes next. I’ll see you at the final review and look forward to your build, test notes and devlog updates ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Share an openable build showing both islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing, with co-op instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Share the five-player session notes. State which parts players tested and what their actions showed about the tide loop.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Confirm who can handle engineering this final week and how many hours they have. Prioritize missing parts of the playable slice.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

